Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.45,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias's newspaper was dated\Ntomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.87,0:00:03.66,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He lived alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.77,0:00:04.88,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He had no subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.32,0:00:07.64,Midnight,,0,0,0,,A misprint — until page nine\Nreported
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.52,Midnight,,0,0,0,,his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.83,0:00:09.70,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Apartment fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:11.86,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Friday. Three a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.86,0:00:12.51,Midnight,,0,0,0,,His name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.53,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He booked a hotel across town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:16.63,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Saturday's paper was at the\Nfront
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.94,Midnight,,0,0,0,,desk. The fire happened anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.17,0:00:19.88,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same building.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.03,0:00:20.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:21.98,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Different man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.99,0:00:23.70,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The dead man was his neighbour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:25.28,Midnight,,0,0,0,,who'd knocked to warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:27.62,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias spread every paper he'd\Nsaved
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.62,0:00:28.78,Midnight,,0,0,0,,across the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:30.16,Midnight,,0,0,0,,All dated tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.39,0:00:31.92,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Each mentioned him less than the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.92,0:00:33.95,Midnight,,0,0,0,,last. First his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:34.77,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Then his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.23,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Then the crossword.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:38.66,Midnight,,0,0,0,,By Friday, his photograph was a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:39.54,Midnight,,0,0,0,,grey rectangle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:41.97,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Saturday's paper arrived blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.18,0:00:43.71,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Only the masthead remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.21,0:00:46.40,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The Midnight Archive: all the\Nnews
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.50,Midnight,,0,0,0,,that never was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:49.71,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias finally understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.71,0:00:51.97,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It wasn't predicting his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:53.78,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It was deciding what to keep.
